{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_008_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:603dc51ea5fcabdc918a767be060babb0d55fdb3cd63e6654224f9829c9292a3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f3e93ff46c21177317695f17de970d054fa75d601c529c3fc263600d9ae66fe",
      "text": "爱马之人",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc12007dc3dc55c582225e2d57bf679b55480ebe3835dbd5c8561c854b09d92e",
      "text": "丽和制作人为了看马而来到了赛马场。\n丽在亮相圈对着马儿侃侃而谈，展现出爱马的一面。\n两人预测了哪匹马会获胜后，\n便向看台走去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f3e93ff46c21177317695f17de970d054fa75d601c529c3fc263600d9ae66fe",
      "text": "爱马之人",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74607743e757a8fb19791ac23d7f598b2980fccd29d1092bece1f3edbffb580c",
      "text": "赛马场·跑道",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a0b54fbd47786930b09200b6b8c2095283b31d2f50796f7304740116158c4ad",
      "text": "今天请多指教了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2139c431fdb06ad5433f5a360895ac53435896b6e6337d92c5414db0c32fc0b6",
      "text": "哪里，我才要请您多指教。\n今天非常感谢您的邀请！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8d59b2504fd0e507a8a4c4ab6443a237b5b32723423631a0acdd343a7ca1979",
      "text": "不用言谢。倒是我才该感谢你，\n你能接受我的邀请让我很高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54adb6254c4cef70478399adde14ce3298eddc9e51e905dfbdfef6ce4917307b",
      "text": "我在事务所看赛马比赛，\n真是看对了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30e74a839c69c8f62a1841c816cf5b935acfbf6c838cad53c53d1939ec8a17f8",
      "text": "难得看到丽先生在音乐之外展现出如此热衷的模样，\n我忍不住就向您搭话了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57f92c1c53b69c1cd80b0cf1c57631dbca1078fbaf3af562f9f5798d6e558f6a",
      "text": "看了比赛后，我非常理解您投入热情的心情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c34b9c28a6bcda20c71c13597d134cb7049a2d9c298c84c8f838d928f94eb5e",
      "text": "嗯。奔跑时充满力量的步伐，\n富有跃动感的肌肉线条……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7579f25859a85b3b2b0e825325345332a42c9408c4bc39e11de1db0a6ace9051",
      "text": "它的魅力真是说也说不尽。希望通过近距离观察马匹，\n能让你哪怕稍微感受一下它的美妙之处。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cecb0bf52c7bbedcca6bc39ad060b5ef0e5be818de69ad0cc2bb1c42db7bfaa",
      "text": "好的！我很期待。话说回来，\n人可真多啊。感觉都要被这股热气吞没了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee1210447f34f998cd20929b85c3340b166a1ea03ac8d0706e21b9ae148b6511",
      "text": "是啊。今天有重赏赛事。\n或许观战的观众们也是干劲十足吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_008rei_01_1_2_008_01:1_2_008_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d77b1032857ca4e6b7acfa6c269cce4954cb828db496dc698a30bce6bb68b6a",
      "text": "首先去亮相圈吧。今天出战主赛事的\n马匹差不多应该在那边了。这边请。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
